#!/usr/bin/env deque
// sky: ants, every way it can be kept, each slide showing the line that
// made it. Run it: deque demo/ants.deque, or leave it going by itself:
// deque demo/ants.deque --loop
//
// Most slides say `grown`, a colony well under way; without it, one begins
// with a queen alone. It's one colony seen two ways: slides that say the same ants in the same
// soil share it, from the side or from above, and going back to it finds it
// as it was left. v goes from one view to the other.

---
fx: assemble
sky: ants ground grown
time: 20s

# ANTS
`sky: ants`

{muted}a colony behind your slides · click to feed it · v for the other view{/}

---
sky: ants grown
time: 45s

## the farm
`sky: ants`

{muted}the nest from the side · they dig it as you watch{/}

---
sky: ants grown
time: 45s

## who's who
```
{accent}the mound{/}     every grain dug, carried up and dropped by the door
{accent}the store{/}     first chamber down: leaf, turned to fungus
{accent}the nursery{/}   eggs, then larvae, then pupae; new ants come out pale
{accent}the midden{/}    where the dead are carried
{accent}the queen{/}     at the bottom, laying while there's food
```

---
sky: ants grown
time: 30s

## feed them
`click` anywhere: food falls, and a forager comes for it

{muted}leafcutters cut their own too, up the plants; the leaves grow back{/}

---
sky: ants black sand grown
time: 40s

## black garden ants, in sand
`sky: ants black sand`

{muted}they cut nothing: they take what falls on the ground{/}

---
sky: ants fire gel grown
time: 40s

## fire ants, in gel
`sky: ants fire gel`

{muted}red, quick, and half as many again{/}

---
sky: ants honeypot sand grown
time: 40s

## honeypot ants
`sky: ants honeypot sand`

{muted}their store is themselves: workers hanging from its roof, full{/}

---
sky: ants army ground grown
time: 45s

## army ants
# RAID
`sky: ants army ground`

{muted}no nest but a hollow for the night · every evening they all move on{/}

---
sky: ants leafcutter soil 12 grown
time: 30s

## a young colony
`sky: ants 12`

{muted}the number is how many workers at most; the queen lays up to it{/}

---
sky: ants 120 grown
time: 40s

## a big one
`sky: ants 120`

---
tr: sand
sky: ants ground grown
time: 45s

## from above
# TRAILS
`sky: ants ground`

{muted}the same colony, those that are out · trails form, round the words{/}

---
sky: ants ground grown
time: 30s

## feed them here too
# CLICK
a click is a pile of food: watch a trail form to it, and fade when it's gone

{muted}twigs fall and lie in the way · a spider comes hunting now and then{/}

---
sky: ants ground fire sand 150 grown
time: 45s

## fire ants, from above
# SWARM
`sky: ants ground fire sand 150`

---
sky: ants ground black gel 30 grown
time: 40s

## a few black ants
# SCOUTS
`sky: ants ground black gel 30`

{muted}fed, the nest sends out more{/}

---
sky: ants grown
time: 45s

## its keeper's keys
```
{accent}v{/}       the other view of the same colony
{accent}i{/}       how it's doing, and the chambers named
{accent}f{/}       follow one ant (or click it); f again lets it go
{accent}[ ]{/}     its time: slower, stopped; faster
{accent}H{/}       what's happened to it
{accent}click{/}   drops food
```

{muted}it's kept between runs · two panes, v in one, show both views at once{/}

---
sky: ants
time: 90s

## from the beginning
`sky: ants`

{muted}a queen alone, and her first eggs · leave it, and come back{/}

---
sky: ants grown
time: 60s

## leave it on
`deque demo/ants.deque --loop`

{muted}it goes round by itself: a farm for a screen left on{/}
